"The Xerox WorkCentre 7970i printer is an outstanding, tabloid, colour all-in-one multi-functional printer. It has print, copy, scan, fax and email features that make it versatile enough for almost any office. Wireless functionality and automatic, double-sided printing make it very user friendly. It also allows for upgrading to the latest version of a special feature that can access cloud-based solutions, protects your data and utilises tools to save money by controlling resources used by the printer. The duty cycle is not very impressive but the finisher options are suitable for any needs.\nThis printer weighs 151.9kg in the base configuration. It measures 640 x 699 x 1149mm. It features a very intuitive and attractive colour touch screen, with large menu options on the black control panel area that faces forward. This printer is certainly larger than others. The colour scheme is white around the sides, with dark blue wrapping around the upper section.\nThe Xerox 7970i prints at an extremely high speed of up to 70 ppm in colour and black. The duty cycle is up to 300,000 pages per month. There are a wide variety of finisher options that can be added to the base printer. Automatic, double-sided printing makes this printer cost-efficient and eco-friendly. Maximum print resolution is outstanding, at up to 1200 x 2400 with enhanced image quality. The first print can be produced in as few as 6.9 seconds for colour and 4.2 seconds for black. The multi-functionality is extremely helpful. The unique feature that provides cloud-based solutions, protects your data and controls printer resources is sure to prove beneficial to your business.\nThe Xerox WorkCentre 7970i is loaded with functionality and technology. It allows many optional finishers to be added, but the finisher options that you will find in its brochure are less standard than the finisher options with other models. Review this model compared to the 7855i model for your needs."
