"#27 Overcoming Jealousy, and what we can learn from it with Sydney Faith Rose on Insight Monday!\nI've worked with the feeling of Jealousy a lot. It comes up in many ways. But mostly, it's seeing specific things that women in my life have that I don't. Usually pertaining to relationship and career success. It's not fun to feel, but, it's also VERY human and I'm sure you've experienced it as well. But when Jealousy is not examined, I believe it can lead to friendships and relationships breaking down.\nIn this episode, one of my besties and wonderful Buddhist Teacher Sydney Faith Rose and I break down Jealousy. I share a story about a recent experience of jealousy, and what I learned from it.\nTo find Sydney Email her at SyndeyFaithRose@gmail.com and you can take her classes at Dharma Punx NYC, which I highly recommend!\nWhat ways have YOU experienced Jealousy? And how did you deal with it? Let us know it comments below."
