ments such as off-site utilities, and the master-planned storm-water treatment system. In addition to the permitting and design of the complete campus, CEG provided construction oversight for the phases of the project that have been constructed. Phase III includes the construction of two additional office buildings totaling 98,488 square feet and associated site amenities."
