"St John Australia (TAS) Inc.\nSt John Community Care aims to build social inclusion by providing companionship and support to members of the community in times of need and improve of life for vulnerable people living independently at home. We provide a personalised service by the one-to-one matching of a Volunteer and Client. The services we offer our clients are befriending, shopping, limited gardening and transport.\nTwo hours is all it takes to befriend or assist a member of your community with their grocery shopping.\nIf you think you have a couple of hours to spare a week or a fortnight.\nWhy not join us at St John Ambulance Community Care."
