"From very simple beginnings in early 1913, the Millane family has enhanced New England\u2019s trees. Millane expert tree pruning, cabling, cavity & pest control abounded from the 1920\u2019s through the 1970\u2019s. By the 1990\u2019s our small local Nursery grew and expanded to over 400 acres (in 5 towns) ~ growing top-quality trees, shrubs and evergreens for both commercial sites and residential properties. Besides providing diverse varieties and a vast selection of quality trees for almost a century, Millane was known and highly respected for extensive tree knowledge, large tree moving and specialty planting throughout the Northeastern US.\nIn late 2016 we closed our Field Growing operation; but our tree knowledge and expertise continues with CONSULTING as a licensed Tree Arborist/Grounds Supervisor and Landscape Designer.\nWe still import & sell high quality Okatsune pruners to maintain beautiful, healthy trees & shrubs.\nWe still provide durable outdoor labels for use in laser printers to many Nurseries & Garden Shops.\nPlease call Michael or Laura Millane for your tree & landscape concerns."
