"Bed and Breakfast in Provence at the foot of Mont Ventoux.\nThe Mas de Longuefeuille is in the country only 5 mns from Malauc\u00e8ne, a charming village with about 3.000 inhabitants.\nThe domaine covering 4 hectares, is a havan of peace and quiet.\nThe surrounding hills are ideal for strolling and rambling.\nThe recent renovation retains the typical character of a traditionnal farm in Provence.\nThe interior is a subtle mixture of modernity and tradition, offering all the necessary conforts.\nThe Mas de Longuefeuille offer you three confortable and well appointed bedrooms with on suite bathroom and independent and separate toilet.\nOn the terrace you can have your the breakfast in the morning and in the evening, it is perfect for relaxing.\nThe full continental breakfast includes: tea or coffee, fruit juice, assortiment of pastries and jams.\nThis will be served either indoors or outdoors, as you like and depending on weather conditions.\nFrom our guest house, a hiking trail will allow you to go at the beautiful site of the Dentelles de Montmirail or to discover villages typical of the region: the Barroux, Crestet, Suzette.\nThe region of Mont Ventoux is ideal for many excursions, whether on foot, by bike, on horseback and only a few kilometres from us: Gorges du Toulourenc - Mont Ventoux - Gorges de la Nesque - Dentelles de Montmirail . We put at your disposal: bicycle and pedestrian excursions guides, maps etc ..\nLocated at the foot of the Mont Ventoux, our guest house offers a stunning panoramic view of the surrounding hills and orchards."
