"Located less than an hour from Burleson, business owners who purchase used office furniture from Office Modular Concepts can typically have their furniture delivered and installed within one business.\nWhether your office needs a suite full of cubicles, desks, file cabinets or a conference room table with chairs our Dallas area warehouse is within half a day of you. The close proximity of our warehouse to Burleson means Burleson businesses can many times order one day and utilize their office furniture the next.\nWhen the Missouri-Kansas-Texas Railroad (The Katy) decided to expand its service from Dennison to Waco they needed a midway depot and simply bought the property and the town surrounding it. Today Burleson is a rapidly growing city experiencing the movement of urbanites from the DFW locale to the outer areas in search of peace and quiet.\nBurleson area zip codes: 76028, 76097.\nMajor corporations calling Burleson home include: Champion Buildings MFG and Basden Steel.\nIf your business is located in Burleson, TX and you are looking for quality used office furniture at up to 80% off retail prices then look no further than Office Modular Concepts where your office furniture is just a day away."
