on your shorts Laura & way to go with the big hair!\nI was originally thinking big knitted pom-poms for some reason but this detailing is sooo cute!!! I like the look of the Boohoo shorts but think I will wait and see how you get on with them first!!\nLove this trend! You should check out your local boutiques- they seem to have the cutest pairs that aren't as mainstream!\nDefinitely interested in hearing how those BooHoo shorts turn out. They look AMAZING!\nLove these picks! Etsy also do so lovely handmade ones!\nYour hair does look voluminous! I love pom poms too... I want a scarf and shorts with them on!"
