"Unlike any other Middle Eastern restaurant in town, Al-Madina Lebanese Cuisine stands for excellence. Serving up authentic meze, hearty main courses plus platters, banquets, desserts and delicious beverages, the restaurant offer many choices to suit your budget and appetite. Found down Terminus Street in Castle Hill close to Castle Towers, Al-Madina attracts diners from all over the Sydney area (yes, it\u2019s that delicious) and just one bite of their hummus is worth making a journey for. Start off with their popular meze options like baba ghanouj, vine leaf rolls, spinach triangles, fattet makdous or tabbouleh before diving into an order of kafta, shish kebab, chicken Beirut, or the zesty chilli garlic prawns. Because the restaurant is such a huge success, booking ahead is always a wise idea."
