"From \u2018Kuthu\u2019 specialist to melody master!\nYou are here: Home \u00bb Featured \u00bb From \u2018Kuthu\u2019 specialist to melody master!\nMusic composer Srikanth Deva, who is nearing the 100th film mark soon with Priyamudan Priya, seems to be a happy man these days. The composer is excited about his upcoming Jiiva\u2013Nayanthara flick Thirunaal in which he is taking on a new avatar. \u201cYes, I have this tag of \u2018kuthu expert\u2019 and I hope this film will break that image \u2014 and prove that I can also score melodious numbers. I have worked hard to create different types of songs,\u201d Srikanth tells DC.\nHe adds that, after a long gap, veteran singer S. Janaki has sung a song, \u2018Thandhayum Yaro Thaayarum Yaro\u2019 in the film. \u201cI had earlier worked with noted singer P. Susheela amma. Then, it was my dream to bring in yet another biggie Janaki amma for a song. We recorded the song in Hyderabad and she completed it in one hour\u2019s time,\u201d adds Srikanth, whose fans gave gave him the sobriquet \u2018Music Star\u2019 recently!\nMangatha on Aug 19; Velayutham 19?"
