"This Pfister Kitchen Faucet is a light weight pull-down product that is loaded with a touch-free technology. The Pfister GT529-ELS is designed to offer you the best and most simple kitchen equipment that will enable you to do your sink chores faster. It will follow your command with your hand gestures and will deliver a perfect flow of water pressure.\nThe look of this Pfister Kitchen Faucet is just perfect. It comprises of a pull down high arc spout that attached with a detachable shower head in the end. It also has a lever on its left side that controls the pressure of water as well as its temperature. The spray head is retractable and can be placed back to its position when you are done, automatically. The effortless sleek look is an inspiration for every faucet and will look perfect with your kitchen decors.\nThere are many significant features that this Pfister Kitchen Faucet that will allow you to enter the next generation of kitchen products. Some of them are mentioned below.\nTo turn the water on or off, all you have to do is wave 4\u201d away from the faucet and the water will do the function.\nThere are some harsh stains that need hot water to properly clean them off. The temperature adjustment in this faucet is fairly simple and can be handled with a sensor mode. Set it once or many times, the sensors will depict your requirements automatically.\nThe pull-down spout is extra large and the retractable sprayer hose acts as the best helping hand. The cleaning and rinsing are made so much easier with this.\nYou can use the lever to manually adjust the temperature and water pressure, in case you are not satisfied with the automatic one.\nThe stylish and sleek look of this faucet doesn\u2019t only look good, but it is also convenient while you control it and use it for delivering optimum water pressure.\nThe spray head serves you with two modes: spray and stream that you can use right from your hand to effectively clean any stubborn stain on your utensils or sink.\nThe chrome or stainless steel finish comes with spot resistant feature.\nPfister Kitchen Faucet loaded with many great technologies like MotionSense that will avoid your direct contact with the faucet.\nThe detailed instructions included in the package makes it easy for you to perform DIY.\nThe React Touch Free Technology makes it work super fast and flawlessly.\nThe temperature set at automatic modes with ease.\nThe Pfister Kitchen Faucet automatically stops after two minutes of running, which might make it tedious sometimes.\nThe water force may be difficult to control sometimes when you want low pressure.\nThis is the ultimate faucet that has it all, from the latest technology to fine pressure. If you are looking for a high-tech kitchen Faucet, then this is the one for you.\nNOT FIT THIS PFISTER KITCHEN FAUCET, LOOK ALSO AFFORDABLE TOUCHLESS KITCHEN FAUCET REVIEWS!"
