"how long was the foot massage?\nSaturday night, Rich and the boys stayed up late watching TV while the rest of us went to bed. The lights were off with only the glow of the television, and the boys were enjoying some time together after their beloved Dad had been away all week for business.\nAs is frequent at our house, and because their Dad is a runner and often has aching feet, the boys were called upon to give their ol\u2019 Dad a foot massage. Seth, our seven year old, was happy to sit at his Dad\u2019s feet and rub them. Eventually, Rich, who is always exhausted by the end of the day, drifted off to never-never land.\nWaking up hours later, he found the living room completely empty and a note on his chest.\nThis entry was posted in Uncategorized and tagged funny, seth by Shanda. Bookmark the permalink.\nHow sweet and responsible of Seth!!"
"There are many reasons why small businesses need advice from a bookkeeping expert, but there are also lots of different types of bookkeeping services, so it pays to know who to go to and when.\nAll businesses start out as an idea and a skill but developing that idea and skill into a profitable business can be challenging. This is where The Bookkeeper comes in: we create the map to your profitable destination.\nOur team helps everyday people, just like you, to start a business, to grow a business, to expand a business, and to fix their business.\nWe understand that knowing where your money is going is just as important as where it is coming from, and that your reports should reflect precisely that.\nWe are featuring Ann\u2019s beloved German Shepherd: Scout, to highlight our pet friendly environment and staff. Scout is super friendly, and she loves other canine playmates. We understand that work environments have changed and evolved, and many of our clients are constantly working whenever and wherever: from their homes, from their cars, from coffee shops, and from just about anywhere besides the office. We, at The Bookkeeper, completely welcome and embrace this concept. We will work right alongside you, and your furry companions can only enhance the experience!\nWhy You Should Use QuickBooks in place of other accounting software!\nSimple bookkeeping tasks are handled automatically making it easier to run your business.\nSo you always know where your business stands.\nQuickBooks is specifically designed to be flexible and adaptable to a wide range of small businesses.\nI would highly recommend Denise and Ann. These ladies are the best!!! I use them for both of my restaurants. They are so easy to deal with and always there for you when you have a question, even at 8pm. They were so helpful in setting up the payroll and getting QuickBooks started. I have used many bookkeepers, and they truly good at what they do. I am so happy I found them.\nFill out a short form to contact us."
