"Charlie. Mr. Charlie is a loving and easy-going pup. He is a Golden Retriever.\nHe loves staring contests. He will do anything for BBQ. Charlie is an unwavering pet to humans (even though he sometimes flies into a panic whenever an alarm clock goes off).\nBut sadly, Charlie's human grew old and moved to a nursing home where he could not bring Charlie. So the human sadly surrendered poor Charlie to the shelter, where he waits patiently for a Rescue Hero.\nThe courageous Charlie never gives up hope, and is 100% convinced today is the day he'll be adopted. Charlie is an easy going, medium energy dog. Charlie's gentle demeanor makes him a great, easy-going lifelong companion. You should know that Charlie is \"overly affectionate\" and he'll be best in a home where he can get to spend plenty of time with humans.\nCharlie is a easy going, medium energy Golden Retriever. Be ready to have this pup always at your side. Also, each dog breed has certain traits. Knowing a little bit about your dog's individual personality and breed personality will give you some clues about how to care for your dog."
