"A good 4* hotel in the middle of downtown Johannesburg. Ideal for guests doing business in the city or leisure travelers looking to explore the historical city. There is Wifi throughout the hotel as well as parking. Location. Situated in city's financial district, central Johannesburg and within walking distance of many of the main banks and restaurants. Sandton convention centre is just a 20 minute drive away and the airport just 30 minutes away. Distance. 17 kms to the nearest airport (or tambo international airport). 1 km to the nearest station (park station). 5 minute walk to the nearest bus stop. 20 km to the nearest fair site (sandton convention center). Rooms. These are modern stylish rooms with en-suite bathrooms and good size beds. Each room has a flat screen satellite TV with pay per view movies, Wifi and tea and coffee making facilities. There is a work desk and chair and good cupboard space. The rooms have one whole wall decorated with wallpaper depicting a Johannesburg cityscape which gives the room real character. Restaurant. The restaurant is open plan and situated behind the reception area and bar and has an open kitchen where guests can see the chefs at work. Breakfast, lunch and dinner served here and both buffet and a la carte food is available. There is also a good wine menu and an oval shaped bar in the centre of the room serving cocktails. Exterior. A tall multistory building in the centre of Johannesburg. Lobby. A small reception desk situated on the 3rd floor with a large fish tank behind the desk, seating for guests and a small area where guests can use a computer for free."
