l, hardwood floors, internet, laundry facility, microwave, patios or balconies. Ask it they allow pets (dogs, cats or other domestic animals) Is there a pool, sauna, spa, volleyball, tennis, basketball courts. Do you want tile floors, vaulted ceiling, walk in closets, washer dryer hookups? What do you need? What do you want? What's your rental budget? CampusRent is the apartment finder that will help you locate your next semester rental, it may even help you find a roommate."
