"Paul Armstrong, PE joined iSixSigma 11 months, 2 weeks ago.\nPaul Armstrong has been helping teams and organizations find creative improvements for processes and systems for over 25 years. He led the Performance Improvement strategy for a major defense contractor for 15 years before starting eNthusaProve, LLC. An advocate of Deming, he has authored a book, Enabling Joy \u2013 Your Calling as a Leader that helps to unpack Deming\u2019s mandate to managers about joy in work. While skilled at the tools of Lean and Six Sigma, Paul makes sure that helping people is his top priority. When not teaming with clients, Paul can be found in Lancaster, PA with his bride of over 35 years, either working their farm or giggling with their grandchildren."
